     The gg__ggeett__iiddeenntt() function returns provider's fixed and unique identi‐
     fier.  The _i_d_e_n_t argument should be at least DISK_IDENT_SIZE big.

     The gg__ggeett__nnaammee() function returns name of the provider, which identifier
